    "chapter": "1",
    "title": "Manual Asset Creation",
    "level": "Beginner",
    "section": "Step 1: Create the Project Structure",
    "content": "1 Open the Octoplant UserClient on your PC. The main window displays the Project tree on the left side. 2 In the Project tree, right-click on the root node or an existing directory where you want to add a new folder. 3 From the context menu, select \"New directory\". A dialog box appears prompting you to enter the directory name. 4 Type a descriptive name for the directory (e.g., Line_01, Conveyor_Belt, or PLC_Programs) and click OK. 5 Repeat steps 2–4 to create any additional sub-directories needed to match your plant's logical structure.",
