    "file": "ch01-asset-creation.html",
    "chapter": "1",
    "title": "Manual Asset Creation",
    "level": "Beginner",
    "section": "Step 2: Create a New Component",
    "content": "1 Right-click on the directory where you want to create the new component in the Project tree. 2 From the context menu, select \"New component\". The component creation dialog opens. 3 Enter a name for the component. This name will appear in the Project tree and should clearly identify the device or program (e.g., PLC_Conveyor_01). 4 Select the appropriate component type from the dropdown list. The component type determines which comparator Octoplant uses to detect changes. Choose the type that matches your project data: • Simatic S7 for STEP 7 / TIA Portal projects • WinCC for WinCC HMI projects • TwinCAT for Beckhoff TwinCAT projects • General for any other file type 5 Click OK to create the component. It will appear in the Project tree under the selected directory.",
