    "section": "Step 3: Copy Project Data into the Component",
    "content": "1 Open Windows Explorer and navigate to the location of your existing project files (e.g., a STEP 7 project folder on your local drive). 2 Copy the project files or folder (Ctrl+C). 3 Navigate to the Octoplant component directory. This is typically located at the path defined in your Octoplant client settings (e.g., C:\\Octoplant\\WorkDir\\[ComponentName]). 4 Paste the project files into the component directory (Ctrl+V). The files are now inside the component's working directory.",
