    "file": "ch05-create-jobs.html",
    "chapter": "5",
    "title": "Create Jobs – Automated Backup",
    "level": "Intermediate",
    "section": "Create Jobs – Automated Backup Configuration",
    "content": "Jobs are the heart of Octoplant's automated backup system. A job defines how, when, and from which device Octoplant automatically reads and archives program data. This chapter walks through creating a component, then configuring a full job with schedule, save policy, compare policy, and email notifications.",
