    "section": "Creating a Job in the AdminClient",
    "content": "1 Open the Octoplant AdminClient and click on Jobs in the left navigation panel. 2 Locate the component you want to create a job for in the Project tree on the right side. 3 Drag the component from the Project tree and drop it into the Jobs view on the left. A new job is automatically created for that component. 💡 AlternativeYou can also click the Create button in the Jobs view and then manually select the component. The drag-and-drop method is faster.",
