    "content": "1 Click on the Schedule field to open the schedule configuration. The default is daily at 1:00 AM. 2 Modify the schedule as needed. For example, set it to run weekly on all days at 11:00 PM for a nightly backup. 3 Click OK to confirm the schedule.",
