    "section": "Configuring Save and Compare Policies",
    "content": "1 In the Save policy section, select Always save backup to ensure a backup file is created in the Octoplant backup folder every time the job runs, regardless of whether changes are detected. 2 In the Compare policy section, select the comparison types to perform after each backup:• Server version ↔ Backup: Compares the current server version with the newly created backup• Previous backup ↔ Backup: Compares the last two backups to detect changes on the device",
