    "level": "Intermediate",
    "section": "Exporting Dashboard Data to CSV",
    "content": "1 Navigate to the dashboard containing the table you want to export. 2 Apply any filters you need (the export respects active filters). 3 Click the CSV Export button (download icon) in the top-right corner of the table. 4 The CSV Export dialog shows the export progress. The file is saved to your browser's Downloads folder. ℹ️ Export LimitA maximum of 50,000 entries can be written to a single CSV file. If the table has more entries, use filters to narrow down the data before exporting.",
