    "chapter": "10",
    "title": "Easy Asset Integrator",
    "level": "Advanced",
    "section": "Updating Existing Assets",
    "content": "1 Re-open the original CSV file. 2 For assets you want to update, delete the value in the 'Imported' status column. This signals to Octoplant that these are existing entries to be updated, not new ones. 3 Make your changes to the asset data in the CSV. 4 Save and re-import the CSV. Octoplant applies the updates to the existing components.",
