    "file": "ch13-active-directory.html",
    "chapter": "13",
    "title": "Active Directory Integration",
    "level": "Admin",
    "section": "Setting Authorization Policies",
    "content": "1 In the user properties, set the authorization policy to allow login via domain password or operating system credentials. 2 With this setting, users can log into Octoplant using the same password they use for Windows — no separate Octoplant password required.",
